<title>PHILIPPINES: BELLE SETS RECORD DATE FOR WARRANTS.</title>
<headline>BELLE SETS RECORD DATE FOR WARRANTS.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leisure concern Belle Corp said on Thursday it had set September 17 as the record date for shareholders to avail of their free warrants.</p>
<p>Shareholders owning five shares will be eligible for one warrant which can be converted to one common share. The warrant can be exercised between one to three years from the date of issue.</p>
<p>The exercise price was set at 8.50 pesos per share.</p>
<p>Belle Corp closed unchanged at 6.60 pesos on Thursday.</p>
